index 0000000..4e9e18c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/11143.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Fixed a crash when the first expression of a module is a number (for example
+``3``), which was incorrectly treated as a docstring and caused
+``TypeError: argument of type 'int' is not iterable`` during assertion
+rewriting.
